{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07430","headline":"送柳使君赴袁州 · 刘长卿","name":"送柳使君赴袁州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宜阳出守新恩至，京口因家始愿违。\n五柳闭门高士去，三苗按节远人归。\n月明江路闻猨断，花暗山城见吏稀。\n惟有郡斋窗里岫，朝朝空对谢玄晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}